window.products.push({"id":294018,"name":"Minos Pour Over Gooseneck Kettle - Stainless Steel with Heat Resistant Wooden Handle; 1.0 L / 34 fl oz Capacity Suitable for Gas, Electric and Ceramic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rz8FYeMVL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Starting your day with a cup of coffee brewed in the kettle that looks this good, you can bet that starting your day the Minos way means starting your day with a good and romantic vibes. Introducing our new Minos Pour Over Kettle with wooden handle. Designed with heavy stainless steel, it is created to last longer. Stainless steel is much stronger, and can stand in an intense heat more than aluminum. The biggest benefit of Minos Pour Over Kettle is its heat resistant wood handle. Experience a romantic and authentic cup of delicious coffee or tea with the NEW Minos Pour Over Kettle. Get yours now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rz8FYeMVL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Minos","source_asin":"B07G92P3K4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G92P3K4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G92P3K4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":294019,"name":"Turquoise Personalized Wedding Ring Dish, Custom Initials & Date Jewelry Holder, Polymer Clay Trinket Dish, Gifts for Her","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ei1KRUQyL.jpg","description":"Turquoise Personalized Custom polymer clay Wedding Ring Holder *Please allow 3-5 days production time, Thank you!..... This dish is hand-painted in Turquoise with hints of Aqua, & 18K Gold Leaf..... *As seen on Polymer Clay Daily magazine (photo #5) ..........Keepsake Gift idea...Home Decor...Trinket Dish.....Anniversary....Birthday.... Makes a fabulous gift for the Bride! Unique Collectible! .......This ring dish was created in my sunny Florida studio, it is a labor-intensive piece of Art, made with loving craftsmanship. **My work is made to be lightweight for a delicate, feminine look. It is not a heavy clunky piece of pottery. It has been hand painted by me, patina inked, and artistically hand detailed with Genuine 18K Gold Leaf pen.... My Ring dishes are unique in that they have a beautiful front decoration, as well as the base side is also totally finished in a coordinating design..... Size: It measures 3 1/4\" across and stands 1 1/2\" tall The interior is stamped with a floral Rose & vine pattern, the base is decorated with a coordinating design in Gold Metallic, with flower feet..... *CUSTOM ENGRAVING: Email me to Request the initials and date that you want to appear in the center of the dish.... #1. (Please contact me before you purchase, if you want more than one custom ring dish made. I will set up a special listing for you!)..... Product Description: These dishes are made from 100% Premo quality polymer clay PVC. They are NOT ceramic, and do not feel like ceramic: polymer clay is very lightweight, and can be slightly flexible, but is very durable (e.g. will not shatter if dropped)....**This dish is not food safe, it is for decoration only, it can not be put in the microwave or oven, and should not be submerged in water The dish can be cleaned with a damp cloth *not a child's toy, as it is fragile..........PLEASE LEAVE ME A NOTE WITH YOUR PURCHASE AS TO THE INITIALS AND DATE YOU WANT ENGRAVED...Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ei1KRUQyL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SK Artisan Jewelry & Gifts","source_asin":"B0734J7BQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0734J7BQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0734J7BQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":294020,"name":"Classic Cuisine Non-Stick Fry Pan with Glass Lid, 12\", Induction Bottom, Dishwasher Safe, Ceramic Finish, Copper Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jIWWyinEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"NON-STICK FRY PAN WITH LID: Features a non-stick technology, scratch-resistant pan with the copper ceramic coating that will help prevent food from sticking to the pan - no more hassle of tossing, mixing, and flipping! Food just slides right out! Sauté your dishes undeniably easier with this! You can peep through the glass lid to prevent overcooked or burned food. COOK HEALTHIER MEALS: No more sticking eggs, pancakes, soft-fleshed fish fillets, cheesy dishes, or stir-fried noodles with Classic Cuisine 12 inch Double Layer Non-stick Frying Pan with Glass Lid! This fry pan allows you to cook with less oil or cook with little to no fat for reduced calorie intake. If you’re health-conscious following a diet plan or a home chef who wants to serve the best delicious healthy foods, this is for you! SUITABLE FOR ALL STOVES: Made from a lightweight yet durable anti-warping, aluminum fry pan base specially designed with allumi-shield extra thick magnetic bottom for even heat distribution - perfect to use on gas, electric, glass stove, and induction cooktops. It is oven-safe, too! Up to 500 degrees Fahrenheit. Whether you’re a chef or a foodie, you will enjoy cooking with this. DISHWASHER SAFE, EFFORTLESS CLEANUP: Clean sticky, and burnt-on food in a breeze! Its durable and wear-resistant nonstick exterior is dishwasher safe and super easy to handwash! Just wipe the gunk out, put it in the dishwasher and it’s good to go - ready for the next dish. A great addition to any kitchen to complete your premium cookware sets for a cooking experience that will last for years. STYLISH COPPER DESIGN, GREAT GIFT IDEA: Our non-stick cookware in a stylish copper finish will add style to your kitchen and will complement any kitchen or home décor to give off a modern look - perfect kitchen accessory addition to any home. A unique, stylish, and functional gift option for Moms, home chefs who love cooking, or for anyone setting up a house with a new kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jIWWyinEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Cuisine","source_asin":"B07B9R3ZMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B9R3ZMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B9R3ZMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
