window.products.push({"id":294355,"name":"BELLA Single Serve K-CUP Brewer and 12 Cup Coffee Maker, Stainless and Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DgRRiFJVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Because coffee deserves options. With the BELLA Triple Brew Coffee Maker, mix up the morning routine with the choice between fresh ground beans or K-cup Packs for your cup of joe. Pick a size (6 oz, 10 oz, or 15 oz) with the option to brew a 12-cup carafe at the same time. The 12-CUP CARAFE features a 24-hour fully programmable timer with brew strength selection. You can wake up to the perfect pot of coffee every morning. The user-friendly illuminated control panel shows time since last brew to indicate freshness and the 1-4 cup selection allows you to brew smaller carafes with the same great balanced flavor. With the pause and serve function you can grab a cup before the brew is finished. The warming plate keeps your carafe of coffee a perfect temperature from the first cup to the last. For your safety, the auto shut-off is programmable from 30 minutes up to 4 hours. SINGLE SERVE: Whether you're in the mood for your favorite ground coffee or looking to add a bit of variety with K-Cup capsules, BELLA has got you covered. The pressurized pump extracts maximum flavor and the water stream adjusts for ground coffee to ensure a full-bodied brew. Chose from 3 brew sizes: 6 oz, 10 oz, or 15 oz and position the adjustable drip tray to fit your cup or travel mug. Your mornings just got that much easier! With the convenient auto shut-off after the brewing is complete, you can simply grab your coffee and enjoy! Permanent Filter Baskets Save Time and Money. The Bella Triple Brew Coffee Maker uses permanent filters, which means you'll never need disposable paper filters again. The permanent filters are dishwasher safe. Easy Care and Cleanup The Triple brew coffee maker is easy to clean. Once a month, you can program the auto-clean cycle for deeper cleaning of the 12-cup carafe side. The removable parts are also dishwasher safe on the top rack. For added convenience, the warming plate is stain-resistant and non-stick.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DgRRiFJVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BELLA","source_asin":"B01347O9DY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01347O9DY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01347O9DY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
