window.products.push({"id":294381,"name":"Anji Mountain Contemporary Rug, 4 ft x 6 ft, Natural With Black Border","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":101.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XmuTeU2ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bamboo rugs have been a traditional floor covering in the Far East for centuries. They add a touch of organic, practical elegance to any space. Our bamboo rugs are made of the finest quality, sustainably harvested bamboo in the world for supreme durability. Kiln-dried bamboo is machine-planed and sanded for a smooth finish. This classic collection offers a variety of intriguing designs and brilliant colors to choose from. Clean surface with a damp, clean cloth. Spot-clean borders with mild dish soap and water solution. Plastic or felt casters are recommended for chair or furniture legs to protect against scratching and cracking of bamboo slats. Height: 0.20 inches. Made in China. Bamboo is remarkable in its renewability—many species can be harvested in as little as four years. By contrast, hardwoods like oak take at least 40 years to mature before they can be harvested. When bamboo is harvested, a new shoot will grow from its extensive root system with no need for additional planting or cultivation. The species of bamboo used in our products (Moso) is sustainably harvested in its native habitat in the Anji Mountains of China. Bamboo is also extremely durable—its fibers are far stronger than wood fibers and much less likely to warp from changing atmospheric conditions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XmuTeU2ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anji Mountain","source_asin":"B089378PXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089378PXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089378PXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
