window.products.push({"id":294414,"name":"4pcs Silicone Drink Coaster, Car Cup Coaster,Non-Slip, Heat-Resistant, Non-Stick,Tabletope Protection Home Decor,Car Interior Accessories, 2.75 in Uni","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819BKGNPprL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【 Wide range of applications, automobile use 】-Our coasters can be used in automobile cup holders, kitchens, offices, restaurants and bars. Compared with other common coasters, our biggest advantage is that our coasters can be applied to the most common car cup holders on the market. Note: The size is 2.75 inches in diameter and 0.2 inches in thickness. Please measure your car before placing an order. The diameter of the cup holder. 🔥【 Keep your cups in place 】- When you drink drinks every day, even when driving, if your drinks are always floating around, then they are a good tool. They can provide a stable grip, will not spill anywhere and make a mess, and prevent some cups from rattling. When driving, you can not only ensure that your drinks will not be spilled, but also protect your cup holder from dust and drinks, reduce wear and tear, and extend the service life. 🔥【 Enhanced durability and easy cleaning 】-The coaster is made of 5 mm thick silicone material, which is soft and can be slightly bent, so it is not easy to tear. This car coaster is very easy to clean. Because it is waterproof and does not leave stains, it can be easily wiped off by just washing with water. 🔥【 Long-term use, not affected by temperature 】- beverage coasters are not easy to wear, flexible and durable, and can be used for cold or hot drinks. Enjoy your favorite alcohol, liquor, juice or other beverages such as beer, wine, whiskey, tropical cocktails, ice water, cola soft drinks, coffee, tea or hot chocolate. 🔥【 Better adhesion, no rhinestones fall off 】- rhinestones look attractive during the day. At night, when the light hits it, the rest of the cup will sparkle. So no one hopes that the rhinestone will fall off the coaster. We added more adhesive between the rhinestone and the coaster to avoid this problem. Note: Please do not over-bend, as over-bending will cause gaps between the rhinestones instead of falling off the rhinestones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819BKGNPprL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lydia's Deal","source_asin":"B09BC1KRHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BC1KRHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BC1KRHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
