window.products.push({"id":294419,"name":"Oaken-Cat Gray Goose Feathers Down Comforter King - 100% Organic Cotton, Medium Warm All Seasons Machine Washable Duvet Insert with Tabs (106x90, Mira","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611ZMD2bdTL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"SOFT & FLUFFY-- Our king grey down feather comforter is 106X90 inches,its cover is made of 100% organic cotton compliant to OCS and OEKO-TEX Standard 100.Soft and safe for delicate skin.Outstand moisture wicking&absorption ability makes the king duvet comforter breathable and dry. GORGEOUS DOWN FEATHER FILLING -- Our organic duvet insert is filled with premium responsibly sourced goose duck down feathers(90% waterfowl feather / 10% down). High cleanness, plush, odorless. This medium weight down feather comforter has advanced temperature regulating ability providing suitable warmth for most people,helping you enhancing the sleep experience in spring, summer, fall, winter. HIGH QUALITY COMFORTER --Double stitched edge piping ensures our goose feather down comforter durable.Rigorous process control makes you zero concern of filling leakage or loose thread.4 size available(Twin, Queen, King and California King). 2 color available(White,Grey). CONSTRUCTION -- Our organic cotton comfmorter featured exquisite end-to-end box-stitch quilting construction keeps the down feather evenly distributed and creates maximum loft and comfort.Clean and refreshing appearance matches room decoration in any style. 4 corner tabs to easily attach cover. USE TIPS --Our duvet is machine washable and dryable. Recommend spread the warm comforter for a few hours or tumble in the dryer for 10 minutes at low temperature at first time use. Use as organic duvet insert in your favorite duvet cover, or alone as down comforter with a top sheet. If necessary, you can wash once to make the organic comforter bloom and soften.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611ZMD2bdTL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oaken-Cat","source_asin":"B082WTK57W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082WTK57W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082WTK57W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
