window.products.push({"id":294514,"name":"CoTa Global Hummingbird Refrigerator Bobble Magnets Set of 3 - Assorted Color Fun Cute Wild Life Animal Bird Bobble Head Magnets For Kitchen Fridge, H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eEoNzNJ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE HUMMINGBIRD BOBBLE MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Bring out the kid in you and display your cute collection of magnets! Play with the bobble magnets whenever you are bored, stressed or taking time off. CoTa Global's Hummingbird Bobble Fridge Magnets will surely entertain anyone who sees the cute magnets bobble with just a little tap. A must-have magnetic home and office accessory to use as convenient noteholders. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors & wild life bird lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique decorative bobble magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures, or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Includes CoTa Global Assorted Color Set of 3 Hummingbird Bobble Fridge Magnets. The magnets feature colorful peacocks standing upright and displaying their characteristic bill. The bobble magnetic decor set features realistic details and colored with vibrant colors making them the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnets measure about 4 inches long. HIGH-QUALITY WILD LIFE ANIMAL BOBBLE HEAD MAGNETS – Fun magnets for refrigerator are made of premium quality plastic construction, durable springs, and strong magnet attached to the back of each 3D-shaped hummingbird figure. The hummingbirds are connected to durable springs that make them bobble and bounce as you open and close the refrigerator door. Make the magnets shake by gently tapping the beautifully designed hummingbirds. IDEAL USE FOR THE WILD LIFE ANIMAL REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet and any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Hummingbird magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge & an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos & drawings. Perfect set of functional multi-use magnets for the home or office workspace.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eEoNzNJ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B008A6XQ2A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008A6XQ2A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008A6XQ2A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":294515,"name":"WAITER TREE Bath Rugs, Non-Slip Bath mats, Absorbent Bathroom Rug, Tumble Dry Chenille Plush Bath Mat for Tub, Shower and Bath Room (20 x 32 inch, Bro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YefpmtloL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌲【Unique Bionic Non-slip Process】 It is not made of PVC glue point, Waiter Tree Bath Rug has better effect on anti-slip and won't easy to age and drop debris. It is not made of TPR, not slippery even if there is water on the ground. No non-woven fabrics are used, it won't weathering and peel off after several washes. It not only non-slip but also keeps the bathroom floor clean and fresh. 🌲【Tumble Dryable】Waiter Tree Bath mats can be dried! To avoid bathroom floor mat dirty, cold, and smelly, we will wash them frequently. Our unique technology makes Bathroom Rugs can be tumble dry on low, which will save you the trouble of not drying for a long time, and keep you always feel warm and dry. 🌲【Upgraded Water Absorption】Chenille with finer fibers has further upgraded water absorption capacity. The moment you step on the bath mat, it can soak up the water like a giant sponge, making your feet feel the ultimate luxury comfortable and enjoyment. 🌲【Perfect Feet Feel】Quality up to 1850g/㎡ , super thick chenille with the thickest part exceeding 1.2 inches, finer and more fluffy, soft and with strong covering sense, the feet are like being wrapped by clouds, with a soft feeling without cooling. And it is easier to stick to the ground, which plays a further anti-slip effect. The large and small chenille particles are distributed in stripes, which are not only anti-slip, but also make each step a new feet feeling experience. 🌲【Easy Care】Use only non-chlorine bleach, do not use softeners. Machine wash separately in cold water. You can tumble dry below 140°F (60°C). Gently shake the mat and pat the surface after drying to fluff the chenille grains and give chenille pile a new life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YefpmtloL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAITER TREE","source_asin":"B09VSJHMCJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSJHMCJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSJHMCJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
