window.products.push({"id":294596,"name":"Department 56 Snow Village Nutcracker Playhouse Miniature Lit Building","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ys421FrvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"On holidays, special days, or every day, avid collectors and beginners enjoy decorating with miniature pieces from the Original Snow Village. Inspired by sparkling winter wonderlands from small town America to the streets of New York, and from Victorian England to the North Pole, the Original Snow Village collection is one of the most popular from Department 56. This stone block opera house is featuring a performance of The Nutcracker, advertised by the large Nutcracker with playbill at the front door. Decorated for the holidays with wreaths and garlands, the house lights up and includes a light cord. Hand crafted of porcelain by Department 56 artists, this piece measures 10 by 6-1/2 by 8-1/4 inches. It was introduced in December 2009. For the best care, remove surface dust with a fine brush or feather duster, and use no liquid cleaners. Each building and accessory in a Department 56 village collection is a beautiful combination of authenticity, whimsy, and enchanting touches designed to warm hearts and homes. Artists develop a town plan for each village, then every detail is carefully thought through and drawn. Sculptors create three-dimensional wax sculptures using skilled hand artistry that results in an incredible level of detail. Each piece is molded by hand. All buildings and accessories are fired for several hours at high temperatures to provide the highest quality and durability. Shrinkage during the firing is planned into the design to accommodate things like die cast details and electric motors. Each building and accessory is painted by hand and then fired a second time to give more durability to the color finish. Finished pieces are carefully packed in protective foam and shipped, after passing a drop test to meet strict quality control standards. The packaging for each piece is custom designed and is meant for long-term use as protection and storage for when pieces are not on display. To care for and clean pieces, use a soft brush or feather duster to remove surface dust. Using a hair dryer on a low, cool setting, or using canned air (used to clean computer components) is also effective to remove dust. Do not use a liquid spray, water, or a soapy water solution to clean pieces, as this may damage the finish. If minor repairs are needed, Super Glue gel formula is recommended as a repair agent. Please be sure to remove all other adhesives before repairing. Old adhesives can be safely removed by using a hairdryer to soften the old glue. The intricately detailed pieces of the Original Snow Village series are as unique and diverse as the regions that inspired them. The exquisitely crafted collection allows individuals to showcase an idyllic, realistic world in a way that reflects personal style, expresses creativity, and brings delight to all who see it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ys421FrvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B003IPE3OS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003IPE3OS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003IPE3OS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
