window.products.push({"id":294623,"name":"Butterfly Curtain Lights 60 LED 13.1FT USB Powered 8 Modes Remote Window Curtain Lights with 12 Butterflies Waterproof Twinkle Lights for Bedroom Chri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gC7iLIsvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✨ 【CURTAIN LIGHTS WITH 8 MODES REMOTE TIMER】 Butterfly Curtain Lights 8 modes: Combination, In Waves, Sequential, SLO GLO, Changing / Flashing, Slow Fade, Twinkle / Flash, and Steady On. Only need to plug in USB interface device,then control by remote control or buttons on USB.2 ways to choose.Remote Control for timer setting will be 6 hours on and 18 hours off per day. Easy to use,More convenient experience. ✨ 【USB Powered(No Plug)& Safe Use】 The curtain fairy lights it is connected by USB cable. You can decorate any place you want just using a mobile power. So it can be powered by power bank or any power devices with USB port, very convenient for operation. Energy saving and eco-friendly and it won't heat after a long time use, so it is very safe for your decoration! ✨ 【13.1FT with 12 String& Easy Installation】 13.1FT Horizontal length,Long enough to decorate the whole floor-to-ceiling windows of the home. No screw required, no need to drill hole your wall. When you hang it up, it can dress your room into a fairyland. Like the butterflies accompany you and take you into a dream world, bringing you an unprecedented warm feeling! ✨ 【Perfect Decoration and Wonderful Gift】 The Curtain Twinkle Lights are perfect for indoor and outdoor decorations. Such as Christmas, Valentine's Day, festival, holiday, wedding, party, home, hotel, commercial building, shopping center, etc. It is definitely a great gift for friends, family, colleagues and loved ones. ✨ 【12 Months Warranty】 Long Size and better Price with 100% Quality Guarantee for 1 year. We are pretty confident about the quality of our lights.If you have any problems, please feel free to contact the seller directly!\"Add to Cart\" now, RECEIVE IT WITHIN 2-5 DAYS! NOTE: IT HAVE A REMOTE CONTROL.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gC7iLIsvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GONIMY","source_asin":"B0B8NN3MB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8NN3MB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8NN3MB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":294624,"name":"1st Choice Clear Plastic Suction Cup Hook,2 Pack Ultra Heavy Duty Hooks Strong Power Lock Hooks Vacuum Traceless Hooks Smooth Waterproof Oil-Proof Wal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fmE-3WIqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Installation and Maintenance Instruction 1. Clean the wall properly, and dry it. 2.Clean the suction pad, put it on the needed location, put the hook on the wall when the hooks are erected(the hook shape like it is in the box), and then press down the hook to squeeze the air out, it will stick to the wall firmly. 3.The suction power relies on draining air out of the sucker cup. 4.Tug it to check it is installed properly and firmly., so the surface must not have any concave-convex, holes, liquid or anything else. Clear Plastic Suction Cup Hook,6 Pack Ultra Heavy Duty Hooks Strong Power Lock Hooks Vacuum Traceless Hooks Smooth Waterproof Oil-Proof Wall Shower Kitchen Window Bathroom Holder Suction hooks are made of high-quality plastic. Can be stuck on many kinds surface, such as glasses, metals, flat tile, mirror. Super vacuum suction cup design offer you strong adhesiveness. No need to worry falling down of your objects. Super sturdy and stable. Remove cleanly, no holes, marks or stain. It is the essential choice for your house. Note: Please make sure the surface is absolutely clean (no residue at all), dry and smooth. Make sure the weight of your hanging items within the bearing range(The suction cup can hold up to 4kg(8.8lb)) Keep the suction cup clean, dry before use Check the suction hooks occasionally. Remove, clean, dry and re-install if necessary When the suction plate is partially deformed or not normally adsorbed, the hook will be soaked for 5-6 minutes in hot water of 70-80 degree","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fmE-3WIqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"1st Choice","source_asin":"B0BG29SDJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG29SDJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG29SDJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
