window.products.push({"id":294695,"name":"TREEWOOL (Pack of 2) Decorative Throw Pillow Covers Starburst Accent 100% Cotton Linen Cushion Shams Casess (18 x 18 Inches / 45 x 45 cm; Mustard)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9159fxVkMsL._AC_SL1467_.jpg","description":"Brand : TreeWool Box Contains : 2 Piece Cushion Cover / Shell only. Cushions are not included.   Carefully hand finished for a superior quality Cushion Cover that is sure to add a great accent to your living room, lounge or bedroom. PRODUCT FEATURES 1. Each unit is made with 100% light weight breathable cotton linen for increased durability  2. Each unit has a high quality hidden / concealed zipper, that allows for easy insertion and removal of pillow inserts  3. In the inside, all fabric edges are stitched with overlock stitches to avoid fray and increase durability of cushion covers  4. These throw pillow cases are suitable for use in sofa / couch & beds  5. Fully machine washable in cold setting. To increase the life of the product, follow the care instructions provided in the label. GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU BUY 1. Due to differences in color saturation settings between each Computer, Laptop, Tablet or Phone the actual product might have a minor color difference to the picture on screen. 2. As each product is entirely handmade, there may be minor size variation ( + or - 0.5 cm ) CHOOSING THE RIGHT PILLOW COVERS (OR) PILLOWS 1. Measure 2 adjacent sides of existing pillows. This will give the size of the pillow cover to choose. E.g., if the pillow is 18 x 18 Inch on the sides, then the pillow cover to choose is 18 x 18 Inch. 2. If buying new pillows, then a) Choose either the same size pillows as the pillow covers (e.g., 18x18 Inch Cover = 18x18 Inch Pillow) (OR) b) Choose up to a maximum of 2 inch bigger pillows than the pillow covers to get a full and plump pillows.(e.g., 18x18 Inch Cover = Up to 20x20 Inch Pillow) ABOUT TREEWOOL We bring our expertise in Home Fashion sector in Europe to the US.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9159fxVkMsL._AC_SL1467_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeWool","source_asin":"B06XCV1T3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-294695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XCV1T3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XCV1T3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
